      "source_quote": "史臣曰：詩云，「無言不酬，無德不報」。",
      "reading": "史臣引詩論言與德必有回應。",
      "note": "史臣引詩論言與德必有回應。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 19,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-shilun:received_sentence1-19",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "此諸將並起自豎夫，出於皁隸芻牧之下，徒以心一乎主，故能奮其鱗翼。",
      "reading": "以役夫、芻牧形容諸將之出身，並以專心事主解釋其顯達。",
      "note": "以役夫、芻牧形容諸將之出身，並以專心事主解釋其顯達。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 19,
      "end_codepoint": 51,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-shilun:received_sentence1-51",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "至於推鋒轉戰，百死而不顧一生，蓋由其心一也。",
      "reading": "又以同一理由解釋其戰時忠勇。",
      "note": "又以同一理由解釋其戰時忠勇。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 51,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-shilun:received_sentence1-73",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "遂饗封侯之報，詩人之言信矣。",
      "reading": "以封侯與詩言相應作結。",
